ss=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/5732298eae2dc5ce5eac92ab2ac685a1.poster.avif?t=1744905267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/5732298eae2dc5ce5eac92ab2ac685a1.webm?t=1744905267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/5732298eae2dc5ce5eac92ab2ac685a1.mp4?t=1744905267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL A TEAM OF QUIRKY INSURGENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may not agree on everything and have different motivations. However, this group has a common goal and must use their unique abilities in unison to achieve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/51de2c2a43f62170490dd9f2d09b504c.poster.avif?t=1744905267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/51de2c2a43f62170490dd9f2d09b504c.webm?t=1744905267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/51de2c2a43f62170490dd9f2d09b504c.mp4?t=1744905267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRAIGHT OUTTA COMIC BOOK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world with a unique visual style. Dive into a comic book with stylized visuals and over-the-top storytelling elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/a326c7a903ce724dff0fe39020e13c65.poster.avif?t=1744905267\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/a326c7a903ce724dff0fe39020e13c65.webm?t=1744905267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024320/extras/a326c7a903ce724dff0fe39020e13c65.mp4?t=1744905267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE SNEAKY OR GO GUNS BLAZING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every objective can be achieved in multiple ways. It's up to you to decide your approach. Position your team to sneakily take out multiple targets at once or shake their souls with a bullet barrage</p>",
